# Coolest Projects Monorepo

Event registration platform. Read `AGENTS.md` at repo root for full architecture.

## Layout

- `apps/api` — NestJS REST API (@coolestprojects/api)
- `apps/admin` — AdminJS (@coolestprojects/admin)
- `apps/registration` — Nuxt 3 registration SPA (Tailwind, Pinia, magic-link login)
- `apps/voting`, `apps/eventguide`, `apps/presentation` — stubs
- `packages/database` — Sequelize models (@coolestprojects/database)
- `.devcontainer/` — nginx TLS proxy, docker-compose, start.sh

## Key rules

- Add/edit Sequelize models in `packages/database/src/models/`, export from `index.ts`, register in `apps/api/src/app.module.ts`
- Rebuild database package after model changes: `npm run build --workspace=@coolestprojects/database`
- Business logic belongs in `*.service.ts`; DTOs in `dto/`; controllers stay thin
- Active event context comes from `InfoInterceptor` — use `@Info()` decorator in controllers
- Use workspace flag for scripts: `npm run <script> -w @coolestprojects/api`
- Never commit `.env`, `dist/`, or `node_modules/`
- After API or registration code changes in dev, run `npm run dev:reload` in the devcontainer if the browser still shows old behavior (rebuilds + restarts API and registration).
- Registration API notes in `apps/registration/MISSING_APIS.md`

## Local URLs (devcontainer)

- Registration SPA: `https://registration.coolestprojects.localhost:8443` (API calls use same-origin `/_api` proxy)
- API (direct): `https://api.coolestprojects.localhost:8443`
- Admin: `https://admin.coolestprojects.localhost:8443`
